    "identifier": "yoton-lava-release-quicklime-hardening",
    "description": "<p>You release a stream of molten matter that spills out and then quickly solidifies. All creatures in range must make a Dexterity saving throw, being Grappled in place and becoming Molten until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p>If a creature that was Molten by this jutsu, takes cold damage before the end of their next turn, they must make a Strength saving throw, being petrified until the beginning of their next turn.</p>\n<p>| #### Art Link / Pinterest Link |</p>",
